        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/coastaltown/_scene_copperhead.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 005e3ab8-508c-471b-8426-53aca5c6ef4b).Image",
        "Description": "LFC #37\r\rTwo of your targets are stunt doubles, for action star\r&quot;Dino Bosco.&quot; Bosco&apos;s manager; Sophie Wilde, also notifies one of the two men, when they are needed on set. So you will have to eliminate her as well.\rOur client is a huge Bosco fan and asked us to keep him unharmed, but believes strongly that he should be doing his own stunts. The client believes by disposing of the two men and their manager, will send a blunt enough message to Dino, to put his &quot;Art&quot; before his life\r\rBy AGNT4T7",
